  displayName: Saifa
  lines:
  - Oh! ah... yes, it is.
  - I...
  - am fine...
  - What exactly...can I order here?
  allChoices:
  - choiceText: Didn't you read the sign? Look around you. We sell alcohol. If you're
      not ordering, then get out.
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1caaececb2e7fd45bdfa1205fbacfe3, type: 2}
  - choiceText: Welcome then! This is the SkrewBall Bar, we usually serve alcohol
      but I can have our kitchen prepare small meals as well.
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bfa45f5bdeef2e940aeba3262cb923e9, type: 2}
